 | CQL spec 3.4.2 | Native protocol v4]\r\nUse HELP for help.\r\ncqlsh> desc keyspaces;\r\n\r\nybdemo_keyspace  system_schema  system_auth  system\r\n```\r\n- discovered that 2 out of 3 T-Servers showing in status DEAD.. but one of them is still running (172.26.65.58). \r\n```\r\n[root@klxcasst2 ~]# ps auxww | grep yb-\r\nroot      3781  0.0  0.0 112708   980 pts/1    S+   08:10   0:00 grep --color=auto yb-\r\nroot     11408  0.6  1.4 861860 230552 pts/0   Sl   Sep05 100:09 ./bin/yb-master --flagfile master.conf\r\nroot     12622  1.4 20.1 5249980 3265688 pts/0 Sl   Sep05 224:59 ./bin/yb-tserver --flagfile tserver.conf\r\nroot     12642  0.0  0.2 404744 37492 pts/0    S    Sep05   0:01 /var/lib/yugabyte-1.3.2.1/postgres/bin/postgres -D /var/lib/yugabyte-1.3.2.1/data01/pg_data -p 5433 -h 172.26.65.58 -k  -c logging_collector=on -c log_directory=/var/lib/yugabyte-1.3.2.1/data01/yb-data/tserver/logs -c shared_preload_libraries=yb_pg_metrics -c yb_pg_metrics.node_name=DEFAULT_NODE_NAME -c yb_pg_metrics.port=13000\r\n```\r\nother 2 servers only have master process running currently:\r\n```\r\nroot     24468  0.5  0.9 615004 147816 pts/0   Sl   Sep05  86:24 ./bin/yb-master --flagfile master.conf\r\n```\r\nAttaching logs from all 3 nodes..\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2337/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/536999547","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2387#issuecomment-536999547","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2387","id":536999547,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNjk5OTU0Nw==","user":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6V